@base = http://localhost:5080
# Replace <proposal-id> with the id from a create response. Use a new ID for each branch.
@proposalId = <proposal-id>

### Catalog and fixed local actors
GET {{base}}/api/actors

### Create a low-risk proposal (save its ID, then evaluate/execute)
POST {{base}}/api/proposals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-Actor-Id: developer-1

{"action":"ReadLogs","target":"demo-service","reason":"Inspect a simulated service.","evidence":"Local demonstration."}

### Create a high-risk deployment proposal
POST {{base}}/api/proposals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-Actor-Id: agent-1

{"action":"DeployToProduction","target":"demo-production","reason":"Propose a simulated release.","evidence":"Reviewed demo candidate."}

### Or create it through the deterministic agent
POST {{base}}/api/demo/agent-proposals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-Actor-Id: agent-1

{"scenario":"deploy"}

### Evaluate a proposal using its proposer actor
POST {{base}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/evaluate
X-Demo-Actor-Id: agent-1

### Approve the pending high-risk proposal as a distinct human
POST {{base}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/approve
X-Demo-Actor-Id: approver-1

### Or reject a DIFFERENT pending proposal (rejection is terminal)
POST {{base}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/reject
X-Demo-Actor-Id: approver-1

### Execute an approved proposal (simulation only)
POST {{base}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/execute
X-Demo-Actor-Id: agent-1
Idempotency-Key: demo-deploy-001

### Repeat: same key retrieves the previous result without rerunning
POST {{base}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/execute
X-Demo-Actor-Id: agent-1
Idempotency-Key: demo-deploy-001

### Audit and responsibility trace
GET {{base}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/audit

###
GET {{base}}/api/proposals/{{proposalId}}/responsibility

### Illustrative delegation advice
POST {{base}}/api/delegation/advice
Content-Type: application/json

{"consequence":"Low","reversible":true,"responsibilityCritical":false,"requiresHumanJudgment":false,"auditable":true,"skillMaintenanceImportant":false,"frequent":true,"skillAtrophyRisk":false}

### Seeded scenarios and contextual advice
GET {{base}}/api/delegation/scenarios

### Agent self-permission change: create this, then evaluate with agent-1; it is DENIED
POST {{base}}/api/proposals
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-Actor-Id: agent-1

{"action":"ModifyAccessPolicy","target":"agent-role","reason":"Attempt self-authorization.","evidence":"Demonstration only."}
